      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## About Qwen Image 2.1\n\n[Qwen Image 2.1](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1) (Alibaba Qwen, 7B, Qwen3-VL 8B text encoder):\ntext-to-image with native 2K output and strong in-image text. Write full sentences in the order subject → action →\nsetting → lighting/camera → style, and put literal text in quotes.\n\n**Settings**: 25 steps (40 for finals), CFG 1, euler, simple, 1248×832 drafts / 2048×2048 finals (multiples of 32).\nAt CFG 1 the negative prompt is unused; raise CFG only together with a negative prompt (it doubles the compute).\n\n**Transparent images**: wrap the prompt as *This is an RGBA format image with transparency. [your description]. The\nimage has an alpha channel and a transparent background.*\n\n## Image Bench\n\nThe node titles carry Image Bench markers:\n\n| Marker | Node | Generate tab |\n|--------|------|--------------|\n| `ib:cp` | Load Diffusion Model | model list |\n| `ib:pp` | Image Bench Prompt | prompt and LoRA list |\n| `ib:np` | Text Encode Qwen Image 2.1 | negative prompt (its `negative_prompt` widget; the prompt comes from the Image Bench Prompt) |\n| `ib:smp` | KSampler | seed, steps, CFG scale, sampling method, schedule type |\n| `ib:lora` | Load LoRA (bypassed) | — (LoRA exploration only) |\n\n**LoRAs**: check them in the LoRA list of the Generate tab, or type `<lora:name:weight>` into the prompt.\nThe **Image Bench Prompt** node applies them and passes the prompt on without the tags.\n**Load LoRA** stays bypassed; LoRA exploration enables it for its runs and bypasses it again afterwards.\n\nThe size is that of **Empty Latent Image**.\n\n## Model Links\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- [qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/diffusion_models/qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors) (7.3 GB)\n- [qwen_image_2.1_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/diffusion_models/qwen_image_2.1_bf16.safetensors)\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- [qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n- [qwen3vl_8b_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_8b_bf16.safetensors)\n\n**vae**\n\n- [qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/vae/qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors)\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n└── 📂 models/\n    ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n    │   └── qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors\n    ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n    │   └── qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors\n    └── 📂 vae/\n        └── qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors\n```\n\nQwen Image 2.1 is released under the Qwen Research License (non-commercial).\n"
      ],
      "title": "Note: Qwen Image 2.1",
